<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Jordan returns five weeks after the consultation. Baclofen 5 mg three times a day made her drowsy for the first week; this has passed, and her mornings are less stiff. Mirabegron has helped: she now gets up once most nights. She had a sore arm for a day after the vaccines and no other reaction. She has had no new symptoms and no infection. The physical therapy evaluation requested at intake has not happened: the clinic&apos;s therapist with experience in multiple sclerosis has a waiting list, and she has not yet been offered a date. Her employer has agreed to the accommodations she asked for. She would like the infusions on days without teaching. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Baclofen</td><td>Drowsy the first week, now settled; stiffness better</td></tr><tr><td>Bladder</td><td>Up once most nights on mirabegron</td></tr><tr><td>Physical therapy</td><td>Not yet seen; waiting list</td></tr><tr><td>Work</td><td>Accommodations agreed</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

